sequenceDiagram
    participant Platform as Platform Operator<br/>(rhods-operator)
    participant API as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+
    participant Module as ray-module-operator<br/>(manager)
    participant FS as Local FS<br/>/opt/manifests to /tmp
    participant Prom as Prometheus
    participant KubeRay as kuberay-operator<br/>(operand)

    Note over Platform,KubeRay: Flow 1: Module enablement and operand deployment
    Platform->>API: Create Deployment ray-module-operator-controller-manager,<br/>Ray/default-ray (applicationsNamespace), ConfigMap odh-ray-config<br/>Auth: Platform SA token
    API-->>Module: Watch events (Ray, ConfigMap odh-ray-config)<br/>HTTPS watch, Module SA token
    alt applicationsNamespace not projected
        Module->>API: Status ApplicationsNamespaceNotProjected, drop finalizer
    else applicationsNamespace set
        Module->>FS: Copy /opt/manifests/kuberay to /tmp/ray-module-manifests,<br/>rewrite params.env (RELATED_IMAGE_*) + namespace, kustomize render
        FS-->>Module: Rendered operand objects (part-of=ray)
        Module->>API: RESTMapper / CRD checks (SCC, cert-manager Issuer/Certificate)
        API-->>Module: Present / absent (cert-manager absent = reconcile error)
        Module->>API: SSA apply (field owner ray): CRDs, RBAC, SCC, Deployment,<br/>Services, webhooks, Issuer/Certificate, NetworkPolicy, ClusterRole ray
        API-->>KubeRay: kuberay-operator Deployment scheduled
        Module->>API: Read Deployments (DeploymentsAvailable), read ConfigMap (distribution)
        Module->>API: Update Ray status (Ready, ProvisioningSucceeded, Degraded, releases)
    end

    Note over Platform,KubeRay: Flow 2: Removal / deletion
    Platform->>API: Set managementState: Removed or delete default-ray<br/>Platform SA token
    API-->>Module: Watch event (deletionTimestamp predicate)
    Module->>API: Delete owned/labeled Deployments, ConfigMaps, Services, SAs,<br/>MutatingWebhookConfigurations, ClusterRoles/Bindings, GC, delete ClusterRole ray
    Note right of Module: ray.io CRDs retained so user RayClusters/RayJobs survive
    Module->>API: Remove finalizer platform.opendatahub.io/finalizer

    Note over Platform,KubeRay: Flow 3: Metrics scrape (module operator)
    Prom->>Module: GET /metrics 8443/TCP HTTPS TLS1.2+<br/>Bearer token
    Module->>API: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>Module SA token
    API-->>Module: Allowed (get on /metrics)
    Module-->>Prom: Prometheus metrics

    Note over Platform,KubeRay: Flow 4: TLS profile change
    Module->>API: GET config.openshift.io/v1 APIServer cluster<br/>bootstrap client, 10s timeout
    API-->>Module: TLS security profile + adherence policy
    API-->>Module: Watch APIServer: profile changed
    Module->>Module: SecurityProfileWatcher cancels manager context, pod restarts with new TLS options
